32	// A pull request the lanes opened before the executor minted branch names — the
33	// update task's `claudinite/update-<day>-<seed>`, an agent session's own name — is
34	// still this task's: its head commit carries the `Claudinite-Task:` trailer, which is
35	// the same authority the movement signals read.
